{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["And the sense of <b>כי את כל התועבות האל</b> [for all these abominations]: that you too, and also your children, should know this, that you may keep them, and the land be pure, and the land not vomit you out." "<b>האל</b> is equivalent to האלה, like ההם / ההמה, and this is not the view of the Gaon [Saadia]."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:48.384154797Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}